correction('P001199','Spinor representation',r'Spinor representation of \(SO(10)\)',r'Linear half-spin representation of \(\operatorname{Spin}(10)\), projective on \(SO(10)\)','The notebook faithfully writes SO; the double-cover qualification follows from the Clifford construction.','both','faithful_error')
