correction('P001204','Bernstein variety equality',r'\(\coprod\{\rho\chi\}/W=\operatorname{Irr}G\)',r'The left-hand object is the cuspidal-support variety; \(\operatorname{Irr}G\to\Omega(G)\) is finite-to-one','The scan records an equality. BDK Section2.1 explicitly gives the surjective finite-to-one map, and reducible induced representations show why equality fails.','both','faithful_error')
